title: >-
  SBMPMS-observability: MATLAB codes for "Melnikov-Based Observability
  Breakdown in Singular Bilinear Periodic Matrix Differential Systems"

abstract: >-
  This repository contains the MATLAB and Python implementations, verified
  numerical outputs, and publication-quality figure for the paper "Melnikov-Based
  Observability Breakdown in Singular Bilinear Periodic Matrix Differential
  Systems" submitted to Chaos, Solitons and Fractals (Elsevier). The worked
  example is verified by direct numerical integration and does not exhibit
  observability rank collapse over the tested range. The repository also includes
  a perturbative Gramian verification and an independent Python/SciPy
  direct-integration cross-check.

version: 2.0.0
